nit: WaitForNoVersion is getting a little narly with this change. There are really two implementations mixed together: the single region and multi-region version. It may be better to split the implementations in two, so the overall function would look something like:

```go
func WaitForNoVersion(...) {
    for lastCount, r := 0, retry.Start(retryOpts); r.Next(); {
        var done bool
        var err error
        if useRegionLiveness(...) {
            done, err = countLeasesByRegion(...)
        } else {
            done, err = countLeases(...)
        }
        if err != nil || done {
            return err
        }
    }
}
```
